        "end_offset": 2323,
        "quote_text": "### Summary\r\n\r\n  When vLLM serves a MOSS-Audio model, a client that can access the /tokenize endpoint can provide request-controlled\r\n  mm_processor_kwargs.\r\n\r\n  MOSS-Audio uses these values to construct MossAudioProcessor instances and stores every distinct instance in an\r\n  unbounded private dictionary. Each processor contains a WhisperFeatureExtractor with an allocated mel-filter array.\r\n\r\n  An attacker can therefore:\r\n\r\n  1. Repeatedly submit distinct processor configurations to cause persistent linear memory growth.\r\n  2. Supply oversized mel_config values to amplify the allocation made by a single request.\r\n\r\n  This can exhaust host memory and terminate or severely degrade the API process. /tokenize is intentionally outside\r\n  vLLM’s API-key-protected route prefixes, so --api-key alone does not restrict access to this endpoint.\r\n\r\n  ### Details\r\n\r\n  TokenizeChatRequest accepts arbitrary mm_processor_kwargs\r\n  (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/bf7eee9d7b2788bafe69f0c21fde6af22a2d3319/vllm/entrypoints/serve/tokenize/protocol.py#L107-L110).\r\n\r\n  The request reaches multimodal processing through:\r\n\r\n  1. ServingTokenization.create_tokenize()\r\n\r\n     (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/bf7eee9d7b2788bafe69f0c21fde6af22a2d3319/vllm/entrypoints/serve/tokenize/serving.py#L84-L92)\r\n\r\n  2. OnlineRenderer.preprocess_chat()\r\n\r\n     (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/bf7eee9d7b2788bafe69f0c21fde6af22a2d3319/vllm/renderers/online_renderer.py#L675-L704)\r\n\r\n  3. BaseRenderer._process_multimodal()\r\n\r\n     (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/bf7eee9d7b2788bafe69f0c21fde6af22a2d3319/vllm/renderers/base.py#L846-L880)\r\n\r\n  4. MossAudioMultiModalProcessor._apply_hf_processor_main()\r\n\r\n     (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/bf7eee9d7b2788bafe69f0c21fde6af22a2d3319/vllm/model_executor/models/moss_audio.py#L1358-L1400)\r\n\r\n  Although /tokenize sets skip_mm_cache=True, this only selects the read-only multimodal processor. Its\r\n  MossAudioProcessin",
